<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Daily Sleeper transaction capture.

  Committable configuration ONLY. Installing/reloading this with launchctl is a
  separate David-gated machine change and has NOT been performed.

  WHY THIS EXISTS: `app/data/league_transactions.db` holds the league's transaction
  history (932 transactions / 1,692 movements as of 2026-08-07) and its capture runner
  exists and works — but as of 2026-08-07 NOTHING INVOKED IT. Measured by grep across
  every installed ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.davidleess.dynasty-*.plist. The store only
  advanced when someone ran it by hand.

  NOT a duplicate of league-capture (09:20): that job snapshots league/rosters/users via
  build_universe_snapshot. Transactions are a DIFFERENT Sleeper endpoint family that the
  snapshot job does not read.

  WHY DAILY MATTERS HERE MORE THAN ELSEWHERE: transactions are EVENT data. A waiver
  claim, trade or drop that is not captured is not recoverable later by re-reading —
  the endpoint serves current state, not an archive we can backfill at leisure. Every
  day unscheduled is a day of league behaviour we may simply never hold.

  Runs 06:30 local — after the nflverse capture (06:15), well before the 09:00-09:45
  serving cluster.

  Cadence: DAILY, per David's 2026-08-07 directive. No flags passed: league id and db
  path default inside the runner, and the full-season sweep is the safe default —
  `current-season-only` would narrow it and is deliberately NOT used here.

  Fails closed: a failed run leaves the last good store in place.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>com.davidleess.dynasty-league-transaction-capture</string>
  <key>RunAtLoad</key>
  <false/>
  <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
  <string>/Users/davidleess/dynasty-genius-product</string>
  <key>StartCalendarInterval</key>
  <dict>
    <key>Hour</key>
    <integer>6</integer>
    <key>Minute</key>
    <integer>30</integer>
  </dict>
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/Users/davidleess/dynasty-genius-product/.venv/bin/python3.14</string>
    <string>/Users/davidleess/dynasty-genius-product/scripts/run_league_transaction_capture.py</string>
  </array>
  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>/Users/davidleess/dynasty-genius-product/app/data/logs/league_transaction_capture.out.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>/Users/davidleess/dynasty-genius-product/app/data/logs/league_transaction_capture.err.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
